[gd_scene format=3]

; The Chimney, over the Slag (map offset (211, -117)): a narrow vent through the bedrock between the Sanctum and the
; Vault, from the Slag's roof up to the slag welling in the Coldstacks' floor: the shortcut home. Ledges of slag set
; hard zig-zag up its throat; at the top the vent's mouth is molten, and only Heat plating passes it.

